config REALTEK_DISPLAY_ENABLE_VCDJ
    bool "Enable VeriSilicon VC9000DJ DecoderJ (JPEG/PNG hardware decode)"
    default n
    help
        Driver for the VeriSilicon (Hantro) VC9000DJ DecoderJ image decoding IP,
        hardware build ID 0x2070. A different IP from the Realtek JPU, sharing no
        register or clock code with it.

        The register base, IRQ, clock and reset contract for this SoC has not been
        delivered yet, so the low level layer is still placeholder code: the driver
        compiles, links and walks the whole vendor call path, but does not decode.

        This is the driver's only build-time option.
